// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_INTRO :
"P3136987767" "<color red>{DEFEAT_BOSS_VILLAIN_GROUP_TEXT}</color><br><br>The Talons of Vengeance are a blight upon Night Ward. Their desire for pure destruction goes against everything we strive for.<br><br>There is only so much that the Black Knights can do to hold off the Talons. We have found one of their dens within Night Ward and wish to enlist your aid in cleansing them."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_INTRO :
"P580651001" "<color red>{DEFEAT_BOSS_VILLAIN_GROUP_TEXT}</color><br><br>Shadow Hunter has sent his pack of animals to a Talons of Vengeance den. A squad of my finest knights attempted to stop them, but they were all wiped out.<br><br>Shadow Hunter must want something from that den; it is our duty to ensure he does not get what he wants. {HeroName}, I request your aid in helping us stop the Spirit Stalkers from growing further in power."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_INTRO :
"P3991874255" "<color red>{DEFEAT_BOSS_VILLAIN_GROUP_TEXT}</color><br><br>The Black Knights have pity upon the creatures called Apparitions. They are a tortured lot who do not deserve the fate they have received. However, it is our sworn duty to ensure they do not cause any further chaos in Night Ward.<br><br>A group of them have entered one of the caverns of the Talons of Vengeance. I believe they are attempting to merge with the Talons to obtain new bodies. We cannot allow this to happen; it could cause further chaos if the Talons of Vengeance were to find out about this. {HeroName}, we are depending on you to go into this cavern and stop the Apparitions."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_INTRO :
"P946697418" "<color red>{DEFEAT_BOSS_VILLAIN_GROUP_TEXT}</color><br><br>The Drudges have once more gone beyond their limits and are forcing our hands. They are attempting to manipulate the broken, destroyed souls of the Talons of Vengeance. A band of them have wiped out the Talons and are using the remains of their souls for their own purposes.<br><br>We, as the forces of order, must take action, {HeroName}. We ask that you stop the Drudges before they do something that cannot be undone."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_INTRO :
"P2574083465" "<color red>{DEFEAT_BOSS_VILLAIN_GROUP_TEXT}</color><br><Br>The Animus Arcana...<br><br><color orange>Sir Lionel sighs.</color><br><br>These chaotic creatures of magic have destroyed one of the dens belonging to the Talons. We would normally be thankful, but the Talons have several objects of power which, if the Animus Arcana find it, could cause massive damage to Night Ward.<br><br>{HeroName}, we would ask that you help the Black Knights keep order and wipe out the members of the Animus within that cavern."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_SEND_OFF :
"P2732015065" "Go forth, {HeroName}, and strike down the forces of chaos and disorder."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_ENTRY_STRING :
"P3454339865" "You step into the lair of the Talons of Vengeance. The stench of blood is heavy in the air."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_ENTRY_STRING :
"P1217120029" "The howl of the Nightstalkers echo throughout the caverns."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_ENTRY_STRING :
"P2501509295" "You can feel a chill in the air, indicating the Apparitions are wandering these caverns."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_ENTRY_STRING :
"P1634994256" "You see drips of wax on the ground from the candles belonging to the Drudges."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_ENTRY_STRING :
"P1339198445" "You can hear the happy yelling of the Animus Arcana, followed by loud sparks of magic."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_TASK_SUCCESS :
"P1356054572" "You've defeated one of the heads of the Talons!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_TASK_SUCCESS :
"P1491993784" "You've stopped the Nightstalkers!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_TASK_SUCCESS :
"P2050702219" "You've stopped the Apparitions from taking over the Talons of Vengeance!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_TASK_SUCCESS :
"P201360410" "You've stopped the Drudges from manipulating the souls of the Talons of Vengeance!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_TASK_SUCCESS :
"P938993582" "You've stopped the Animus Arcana!"
// Script Variable BOSS_NAME :
"P4163493360" "Head Oracle"
// Script Variable BOSS_NAME :
"P555124098" "Pack Leader"
// Script Variable BOSS_NAME :
"P1126581370" "Powerful Spectre"
// Script Variable BOSS_NAME :
"P123998200" "Remote Taskmaster"
// Script Variable BOSS_NAME :
"P487299179" "Chaotic Magic"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_INACTIVE :
"P239443349" "Those Black Knights are mere pawns to be tossed away in our conquest of Night Ward."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_INACTIVE :
"P856364347" ""
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_INACTIVE :
"P2954680218" "HATE... DEVOUR... FREE... KILL THEM ALL!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_INACTIVE :
"P2958637216" "Alright gents, let's get these winged birds all set for our experimentation."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_INACTIVE :
"P2293388809" "Hey! Magic! Over here! We can use all of this! Really well!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_ACTIVE :
"P1984957793" "{HeroName}! You will not stand in our way!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_ACTIVE :
"P1852880021" "KILL YOU! FREEDOM! FREEDOM FROM ALL!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_ACTIVE :
"P368110358" "Well, we've got one of the outsiders here. Look alive gents!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_ACTIVE :
"P2885734039" "Oh, wow! {HeroName} is here! Let's see what we can do with them!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS2_INACTIVE :
"P4010612417" "First Ward was a loss, but we shall ensure that justice prevails in Night Ward."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS2_INACTIVE :
"P2860209781" "FEED THE HATE! FEED THE ANGER!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS2_INACTIVE :
"P3087959981" "Let's keep this operation going, we don't have all day."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS2_INACTIVE :
"P1652708658" "This is really crazy magic here! It's going to be so much fun!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS2_ACTIVE :
"P1646604613" "You will be the first of many to die, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS2_ACTIVE :
"P2758178429" "YOU! HATE! BEAT! DESTROY!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS2_ACTIVE :
"P1891789220" "Smells like an outsider is in the area. You all know how to handle this!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS2_ACTIVE :
"P3633975164" "{HeroName}! You can have tons of fun with us!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS3_INACTIVE :
"P3478012818" "There is much work to be done, sisters, but we shall thwart whoever stands in our way."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS3_INACTIVE :
"P2888015300" "RIP... DESTROY... STOP THEM...!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS3_INACTIVE :
"P1404561057" "No dilly-dallying gents, we've got proper tasks to take care of today."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS3_INACTIVE :
"P2291201650" "So much fun in this place! Let's make some MORE fun!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS3_ACTIVE :
"P1839241264" "You will not stop us, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS3_ACTIVE :
"P213983811" "DESTROY THEM ALL!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS3_ACTIVE :
"P2057854859" "Stop the outsider, then pick the pace up!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS3_ACTIVE :
"P3282489849" "I bet you can't have as much fun as us, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_GROUP1_INACTIVE :
"P4248566353" "Can't believe we've gotta do all this... would rather be out in the crags, if you ask me."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_GROUP2_INACTIVE :
"P545728860" "Night Ward shall be ours, and then we shall ensure no soul escapes our grasp!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_GROUP2_INACTIVE :
"P2665931086" "Feel... the hatred... the justice... flowing..."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_GROUP2_INACTIVE :
"P1144031618" "This 'ole thing feels a bit much, don't you think? Getting' the souls of the birdies?"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_GROUP2_ACTIVE :
"P470994963" "You cannot stop our power!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_INTRO_OFFICE :
"P1583206678" "<color red>{DEFEAT_BOSS_VILLAIN_GROUP_OFFICE_TEXT}</color><br><br>The Talons of Vengeance are a blight upon Night Ward. Their desire for pure destruction goes against everything we strive for.<br><br>A group of Talons recently ravaged an office building that was filled with innocents. They linger there still, perhaps awaiting more to arrive. Justice must be delivered swiftly to these monsters, {HeroName}."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_INTRO_OFFICE :
"P3194940634" "<color red>{DEFEAT_BOSS_VILLAIN_GROUP_OFFICE_TEXT}</color><br><br>The Spirit Stalkers have just killed a squad of my finest men, {HeroName}.<br><br>This slaughter must be addressed; Shadow Hunter must know that the Black Knights will not stand for this rampant chaos and destruction! These beasts were last sighted in one of the offices in Night Ward."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_INTRO_OFFICE :
"P3558726614" "<color red>{DEFEAT_BOSS_VILLAIN_GROUP_OFFICE_TEXT}</color><br><br>The Black Knights have pity upon the creatures called Apparitions. They are a tortured lot who do not deserve the fate they have received. However, it is our sworn duty to ensure they do not cause any further chaos in Night Ward.<br><br>A large group of Apparitions have recently entered a nearby office building, drawn there by some force. One of our scouts indicated that they intend to use the office as a trap for any innocent souls that might be nearby, or even those such as yourself who possess a body. You must go into that office and eliminate them, {HeroName}, before they can bring any more harm into Night Ward."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_INTRO_OFFICE :
"P58048392" "<color red>{DEFEAT_BOSS_VILLAIN_GROUP_OFFICE_TEXT}</color><br><br>The Drudges have once more gone beyond their limits and are forcing our hands.<br><br>They are attempting to establish a link between some offices in Night Ward and offices within the regular world of Praetoria. Their goal is to force regular souls in the normal world into Night Ward so they may get more of their 'pay'. The Black Knights cannot allow this! {HeroName}, we request that you stop the Drudges and show them that they are not above the law of Night Ward."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_INTRO_OFFICE :
"P4052139865" "<color red>{DEFEAT_BOSS_VILLAIN_GROUP_OFFICE_TEXT}</color><br><Br>The Animus Arcana...<br><br><color orange>Sir Lionel grumbles to himself.</color><br><br>A group of them have suddenly appeared within an office in Night Ward. We believe it was caused by a spell gone wrong within First Ward. These Animus are wild and chaotic, {HeroName}. If they get out of that office building, they will cause untold destruction throughout Night Ward. We request that you handle the situation in the office before it spills out into Night Ward."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_ENTRY_STRING_OFFICE :
"P3944239358" "The Talons showed no mercy to the people who once wandered the halls of this office building."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_ENTRY_STRING_OFFICE :
"P3456420092" "You step over pieces of torn apart armor belonging to the slain Black Knights."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_ENTRY_STRING_OFFICE :
"P2655005666" "The Apparitions lie in wait to trap any innocents that might be wander in here. They'll be in for a rude surprise when they see you."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_ENTRY_STRING_OFFICE :
"P98477505" "You can sense there's a strong presence of magic in this building, fueled by the Drudges desire for their payment of wax."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_ENTRY_STRING_OFFICE :
"P3620246875" "Chaotic magic sparks throughout the air of this office building."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_TASK_SUCCESS_OFFICE :
"P4039901986" "You defeated the Talons of Vengeance!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_TASK_SUCCESS_OFFICE :
"P1370826500" "You defeated the Spirit Stalkers!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_TASK_SUCCESS_OFFICE :
"P3765281939" "You defeated the Apparitions!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_TASK_SUCCESS_OFFICE :
"P114947659" "You defeated the Drudges!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_TASK_SUCCESS_OFFICE :
"P96906265" "You defeated the Animus Arcana!"
// Script Variable BOSS_NAME_OFFICE :
"P3143582368" "Hateful Spectre"
// Script Variable BOSS_NAME_OFFICE :
"P2675132786" "Head Taskmaster"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_INACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P2903332324" "There shall be no mercy for those who run from our gaze."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_INACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P647148166" "BRING THEM ALL! TEAR THEM DOWN!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_INACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P3257902969" "Keep it moving, we don't have all day here."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_INACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P2535381582" "Wow! This world looks REALLY cool! I can't wait to get out and see it all!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_ACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P3125099022" "{HeroName}!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_ACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P626416638" "TEAR... THEM... DOWN...!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_ACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P1179569668" "Deal with the outsider!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_ACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P318581678" "Cool! Someone to test my magic on!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS2_INACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P1096499308" "We shall convert these souls to our order!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS2_INACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P1870233845" "TRAITORS! LIARS! ALL OF THEM!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS2_INACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P459116549" "We're on a schedule, gentlemen. That wax is as good as ours."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS2_INACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P1238215917" "I can feel a ton of power in me! I wonder what will happen if I let it all out?"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS2_ACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P2505438188" "You will be the next to join us, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS2_ACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P2384365128" "YOU WILL NOT TRICK ME AGAIN!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS2_ACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P3207693638" "Handle the outsider, we can't fall behind!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS2_ACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P2624503138" "Oh, let me test this power on you!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS3_INACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P1600464492" "The Carrion Feast shall continue!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS3_INACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P3802554133" "THE LOVE WAS NOT REAL!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS3_INACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P3189960024" "We'll get plenty of souls from this job, gentlemen."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS3_INACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P2001633672" "I'm gonna explode with all this magic! I can't wait to see all the pretty lights when I do!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS3_ACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P2650720864" "You will not stop the feast, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS3_ACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P2659722800" "YOU WILL FEEL MY PAIN!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS3_ACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P1576227067" "Of course, an outsider has to get in the way."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS3_ACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P1462051234" "I can show you all my pretty lights! Look!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_GROUP2_INACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P3961740913" "These souls will do well!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_GROUP3_INACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P1597959128" "The slaying shall continue, we must push onward!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_INTRO_TECH :
"P4156488871" "<color red>{DEFEAT_BOSS_VILLAIN_GROUP_TECH_TEXT}</color><br><br>The Talons of Vengeance are a blight upon Night Ward. Their desire for pure destruction goes against everything we strive for.<br><br>A group of Talons recently wiped out a group of Drudges who were performing services in an old tech lab. The Drudges have caused us trouble in the past, but we cannot abide by the reckless destruction by the Talons.<br><br>{HeroName}, we request that you deliver justice upon the Talons; show them that the Black Knights will not stand for their chaos."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_INTRO_TECH :
"P3877735767" "<color red>{DEFEAT_BOSS_VILLAIN_GROUP_TECH_TEXT}</color><br><br>Shadow Hunter has ordered his Spirit Stalkers to feast on a group of the Midnighters. The Black Knights have set up a trap for the Spirit Stalkers, luring them into an old lab within Night Ward.<br><br>We request that you storm the lab and finish off the Spirit Stalkers, {HeroName}, before they become aware of the trap and break free."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_INTRO_TECH :
"P3096383218" "<color red>{DEFEAT_BOSS_VILLAIN_GROUP_TECH_TEXT}</color><br><br>The Black Knights have pity upon the creatures called Apparitions. They are a tortured lot who do not deserve the fate they have received. However, it is our sworn duty to ensure they do not cause any further chaos in Night Ward.<br><br>A large group of Apparitions have appeared within an old laboratory. We believe the forces in Praetoria recently created a new group of Seers, causing these angered Apparitions to appear. We must strike swiftly, {HeroName}, and stop these Apparitions from attacking the forces of Night Ward."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_INTRO_TECH :
"P3423333611" "<color red>{DEFEAT_BOSS_VILLAIN_GROUP_TECH_TEXT}</color><br><br>The Drudges have once more gone beyond their limits and are forcing our hands.<br><br>They're investigating a way to use the old labs in Night Ward to generate 'fake souls' for their payments. While it would be terrific to have them no longer using their power for evil, this will only lead them down a more nefarious path. These Drudges must be stopped before they stumble upon something horrific, {HeroName}."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_INTRO_TECH :
"P359982168" "<color red>{DEFEAT_BOSS_VILLAIN_GROUP_TECH_TEXT}</color><br><Br>The Animus Arcana...<br><br><color orange>Sir Lionel groans.</color><br><br>A group of them have wandered into a laboratory in Night Ward. A group of my knights went to investigate them, but only one returned. Their magic is going out of control due to the presence of several unstable chemicals and technology in that lab. There is a high risk of it exploding and taking out a part of Night Ward.<br><br>{HeroName}, you must tend to this as soon as you can."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_ENTRY_STRING_TECH :
"P1271351717" "Wax and blood covers the door to the tech lab. The Talons of Vengeance showed no mercy to the Drudges, it seems."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_ENTRY_STRING_TECH :
"P1304645763" "The Black Knights were clever in setting up this trap. It's time for you to finish the job for them."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_ENTRY_STRING_TECH :
"P1427551570" "The air in this lab feels tense from the hate of the Apparitions."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_ENTRY_STRING_TECH :
"P1206073729" "Drudges and science don't really seem to match, which is probably why Sir Lionel is so concerned about their work here."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_ENTRY_STRING_TECH :
"P1502385215" "Animus Arcana and science don't match at all. You'll have to work fast or risk being caught in a possible explosion!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_INACTIVE_TECH :
"P4023112556" "The Drudges are just the first of many to feel our anger!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_INACTIVE_TECH :
"P1028113987" "WHY?! I NEVER WANTED THIS! WHY DID YOU DO THIS TO ME?!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_INACTIVE_TECH :
"P2568792901" "I say, this science is quite interesting! We need to see how much more of it we could use."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_INACTIVE_TECH :
"P1852697363" "This technology is really neat! What happens if I try putting some of my magic into it?"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_ACTIVE_TECH :
"P3543570777" "You are next, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_ACTIVE_TECH :
"P3997163665" "YOU WILL FEEL MY SORROW! MY ANGER!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_ACTIVE_TECH :
"P2467314741" "I hear the sound of an outsider. Don't get in the way of our investigations!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_ACTIVE_TECH :
"P2032708857" "Oooo! Let's see what happens when we use magic around all of this!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS2_INACTIVE_TECH :
"P3038269593" "Those fools were pathetic. They cannot hope to stand against the Carrion Feast!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS2_INACTIVE_TECH :
"P263130013" "THEY NEVER... I NEVER WAS ABLE... WHY DID I DIE AND HE LIVE?!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS2_INACTIVE_TECH :
"P1647605982" "Hrm, let's be careful about looking too much into this science path."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS2_INACTIVE_TECH :
"P2927267001" "I can't WAIT to see how this is all going to turn out!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS2_ACTIVE_TECH :
"P1974764636" "You believe you can stop us, {HeroName}?"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS2_ACTIVE_TECH :
"P3800088649" "SO MUCH ANGER! TOO MUCH!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS2_ACTIVE_TECH :
"P2946118631" "Can't we have a moment's peace?"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS2_ACTIVE_TECH :
"P828458775" "You're going to be a lot of fun to play with!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS3_INACTIVE_TECH :
"P3200566819" "The Drudges are doomed. We shall feast on all of them!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS3_INACTIVE_TECH :
"P691894486" "ANGER IS TRUTH! THE ANGER IS MINE, I CAN USE IT!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS3_INACTIVE_TECH :
"P3505952796" "The things we do for a proper payment, eh gentlemen?"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS3_INACTIVE_TECH :
"P1833671823" "I should be careful with this... OR... I can just do whatever I want and see what happens!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS3_ACTIVE_TECH :
"P2296628966" "Why get in our way, {HeroName}?"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS3_ACTIVE_TECH :
"P3960106812" "I WILL SHOW YOU MY TRUTH! MY LIFE!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS3_ACTIVE_TECH :
"P3136464095" "An outsider, how annoying. Well, let's get this over with."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS3_ACTIVE_TECH :
"P2370928200" "I'll go with doing whatever I want!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_GROUP1_INACTIVE_TECH :
"P3974609112" "Those greedy fools will not be able to withstand our full power."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_GROUP2_INACTIVE_TECH :
"P3827071739" "They exist solely for their own greed. They shall be wiped out."
// Script Variable MISSION2_INTRO_TECH :
"P902476365" "<color red>{MISSION2_VILLAINGROUP_TECH_TEXT}</color><br><br>The Talons of Vengeance are a blight upon Night Ward. Their desire for pure destruction goes against everything we strive for.<br><br>A Talon by the name of {MISSION2_BOSS_NAME_TECH} had kidnapped one of our own knights, {MISSION2_HOSTAGE_NAME_TECH}, along with the treasure he guarded.<br><br>She and the rest of her cursed allies have found shelter in a laboratory. {HeroName}, I must ask you to rescue our dear knight, recover the treasure, and take down this vile creature."
// Script Variable MISSION2_INTRO_TECH :
"P3440402052" "<color red>{MISSION2_VILLAINGROUP_TECH_TEXT}</color><br><br>Shadow Hunter has bred a fell beast by the name of Ahrica. The beast and its pack have attack a laboratory and have surrounded a wayward civilian named Graham Day, waiting to devour him. {HeroName}, you must stop this Ahrica, save the spirit, and recover whatever magical device Shadow Hunter is using to lure this civilian out into the open."
// Script Variable MISSION2_INTRO_TECH :
"P2140097363" "<color red>{MISSION2_VILLAINGROUP_TECH_TEXT}</color><br><br>The Black Knights have pity upon the creatures called Apparitions. They are a tortured lot who do not deserve the fate they have received. However, it is our sworn duty to ensure they do not cause any further chaos in Night Ward.<br><br>A particularly powerful spectre has dragged a member of the Carnival of Light into one of the abandoned laboratories in Night Ward. We are unsure of what they wish from the Carnival, but they've also taken an ancient tablet that the Carnival had recovered.<br><br>{HeroName}, we request that you intervene and save the member of the Carnival, defeat this powerful spectre, and recover the ancient tablet."
// Script Variable MISSION2_ENTRY_TECH :
"P2924376545" "The missing knight is in here somewhere, along with {MISSION2_BOSS_NAME_TECH}."
// Script Variable MISSION2_ENTRY_TECH :
"P2959560610" "The Spirit Stalkers have surrounded a poor civilian somewhere within this lab."
// Script Variable MISSION2_ENTRY_TECH :
"P3152480963" "You can see marks on the ground from combat. The Carnival of Light acolyte must have fought hard against the Apparitions."
// Script Variable MISSION2_BOSS_NAME_TECH :
"P3516381130" "Caliope"
// Script Variable MISSION2_BOSS_NAME_TECH :
"P4269878501" "Ahrica"
// Script Variable MISSION2_BOSS_INACTIVE_TECH :
"P392602694" "We will make the Black Knight into one of our own!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_BOSS_INACTIVE_TECH :
"P3376081590" "KILL... YOU... ALL... MURDER... VENGEANCE...!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_BOSS_ACTIVE_TECH :
"P1519385928" "You cannot stop our goals, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_BOSS_ACTIVE_TECH :
"P250320562" "TEAR YOU APART!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_NAME_TECH :
"P2986824351" "Sir Willfred"
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_NAME_TECH :
"P3834801631" "Graham Day"
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_NAME_TECH :
"P39198104" "Luminous Acolyte"
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_TECH :
"P3409661581" "You shall not get away with this. Sir Lionel will ensure it."
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_TECH :
"P1770400670" "Get away from me you beasts!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_TECH :
"P4273615591" "You don't know what you're doing!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_ACTIVE_TECH :
"P2146417141" "Were you sent by sir Lionel?"
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_ACTIVE_TECH :
"P3066119026" "Help! Over here!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_ACTIVE_TECH :
"P2992452420" "Please, give me a hand here!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_THANKS_TECH :
"P2660015101" "You have my thanks."
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_THANKS_TECH :
"P3038800846" "Thank you so much, I thought... well, I don't know WHAT I thought was going to happen!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_THANKS_TECH :
"P1191013585" "Thank you so much. Did you happen to find the tablet?"
// Script Variable MISSION2_VILLAIN_INACTIVE_TECH :
"P593795845" "Your knights will not save you, not now, not ever."
// Script Variable MISSION2_VILLAIN_INACTIVE_TECH :
"P3706521506" "DIE! DIE! BLOOD! ANGER! FURY!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_VILLAIN_ACTIVE_TECH :
"P4015969730" "Why are you here, {HeroName}?!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_VILLAIN_ACTIVE_TECH :
"P3345396808" "YOU DIE NOW!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_GLOWIE_NAME_TECH :
"P2635313110" "Black Knight Treasure"
// Script Variable MISSION2_GLOWIE_NAME_TECH :
"P1630735510" "Magical Altar"
// Script Variable MISSION2_GLOWIE_NAME_TECH :
"P2720790616" "Ancient Tablet"
// Script Variable MISSION2_INTRO_WAREHOUSE :
"P1441712905" "<color red>{MISSION2_VILLAINGROUP_WAREHOUSE_TEXT}</color><br><br>Shadow Hunter's pack has stormed into a nearby warehouse, where they seem to have one of the Drudges held captive. They're being led by an animal called Omisch, one of Shadow Hunter's powerful pack leaders.<br><br>Our responsibility is to maintain order within Night Ward, {HeroName}, therefore, it is our duty to save this member of the Drudges. Make sure to recover the souls that the Drudge was carrying as well; the Black Knights will sort out their proper fates."
// Script Variable MISSION2_INTRO_WAREHOUSE :
"P49212393" "<color red>{MISSION2_VILLAINGROUP_WAREHOUSE_TEXT}</color><br><br>The Drudges have destroyed several magic beings within the Animus Arcana and are attempting to find something that resembles a soul within them. There's an item that they're using that is drawing the attention of the Animus.<br><br>{HeroName}, we must stop this before the Drudges stir the Animus Arcana. You must track down the Drudge who is leading this operation, rescue any remaining Animus Arcana, and recover the device they're using to draw these magical beings."
// Script Variable MISSION2_ENTRY_WAREHOUSE :
"P3304369596" "You can hear the Spirit Stalkers running around in the warehouse, growling and waiting for a challenge."
// Script Variable MISSION2_ENTRY_WAREHOUSE :
"P110271319" "You can feel a sort of magical pull in this area. The Drudges must be using this to attract the Animus Arcana."
// Script Variable MISSION2_BOSS_NAME_WAREHOUSE :
"P119893034" "Omisch"
// Script Variable MISSION2_BOSS_INACTIVE_WAREHOUSE :
"P967836848" "We need to get more of 'em machines made, gents. They're right proper for dragging these magical misfits towards us."
// Script Variable MISSION2_BOSS_ACTIVE_WAREHOUSE :
"P1800872648" "Looks like we dragged ourselves an outsider as well!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_NAME_WAREHOUSE :
"P2031860512" "Captured Drudge"
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_NAME_WAREHOUSE :
"P1957966595" "Ball of Light"
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_WAREHOUSE :
"P4049633552" "'Oy! Let me go you hoofs! I got work to do and wax to earn!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_WAREHOUSE :
"P4271685285" "Wow! What are you guys going to do next? This sure is fun, I'm excited!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_ACTIVE_WAREHOUSE :
"P120618006" "What's that? An outsider?"
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_ACTIVE_WAREHOUSE :
"P1538071200" "Oh, this is so cool! There are more people showing up!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_THANKS_WAREHOUSE :
"P490465789" "Well, good on you and them clanks for savin' me."
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_THANKS_WAREHOUSE :
"P655111696" "I think I'm going to go back outside now, bye bye!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_VILLAIN_INACTIVE_WAREHOUSE :
"P3413101911" "This thing is bloody annoying! When're we gonna toss it?"
// Script Variable MISSION2_VILLAIN_ACTIVE_WAREHOUSE :
"P482674308" "Great, an outsider, just the thing we're needin' right now!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_GLOWIE_NAME_WAREHOUSE :
"P1191910280" "Spirit Chest"
// Script Variable MISSION2_GLOWIE_NAME_WAREHOUSE :
"P2081286100" "Animus Attractor"
// Script Variable MISSION2_INTRO_TUNNELS :
"P2027404662" "<color red>{MISSION2_VILLAINGROUP_TUNNELS_TEXT}</color><br><br>The Talons of Vengeance are a blight upon Night Ward. Their desire for pure destruction goes against everything we strive for.<br><br>A group of Talons have begun transforming civilians who were lured into Night Ward within a tunnel system. {HeroName}, you must rescue any civilians you can find and stop the oracle. We have word that a member of Powers Division died trying to save the civilians; for his sake, please recover their remains so we may perform a proper burial."
// Script Variable MISSION2_INTRO_TUNNELS :
"P3247231432" "<color red>{MISSION2_VILLAINGROUP_TUNNELS_TEXT}</color><br><br>The Black Knights have pity upon the creatures called Apparitions. They are a tortured lot who do not deserve the fate they have received. However, it is our sworn duty to ensure they do not cause any further chaos in Night Ward.<br><br>There is a Seer trapped within Night Ward. It seems she was drawn to here in search of the part of her that was missing. However, she found only violence and chaos in her search. This Seer must be saved, {HeroName}, and the portion of her mind destroyed before <i>it</i> destroys her. Activate a sigil within the area to attempt to capture the Apparition; perhaps there is still a chance of reuniting her with her memories if we can keep part of the apparition within the sigil."
// Script Variable MISSION2_ENTRY_TUNNELS :
"P242413823" "You can see drag marks on the ground, formed by the unwilling captives of the Talons."
// Script Variable MISSION2_ENTRY_TUNNELS :
"P2984306673" "This Seer must have had an incredibly strong memory for her to come all the way to Night Ward for this."
// Script Variable MISSION2_BOSS_INACTIVE_TUNNELS :
"P884581314" "We'll take many more before the day is over."
// Script Variable MISSION2_BOSS_INACTIVE_TUNNELS :
"P3085923990" "DIE! SHE MADE THE CHOICE!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_BOSS_ACTIVE_TUNNELS :
"P1824161324" "The armies must be full for the feast!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_BOSS_ACTIVE_TUNNELS :
"P3348956977" "YOU PAY THE PRICE!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_NAME_TUNNELS :
"P501004888" "Transformed Citizen"
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_NAME_TUNNELS :
"P244901103" "Seer"
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_TUNNELS :
"P118439948" "Filled with... such... hate...!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_TUNNELS :
"P3514462294" "..."
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_ACTIVE_TUNNELS :
"P3327988619" "What is going on...?"
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_THANKS_TUNNELS :
"P1308868640" "I... I don't know what's happening to me."
// Script Variable MISSION2_VILLAIN_INACTIVE_TUNNELS :
"P1203352080" "DIE! THE ORIGINATOR! DIE!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_GLOWIE_NAME_TUNNELS :
"P4052271343" "Power Division Remains"
// Script Variable MISSION2_GLOWIE_NAME_TUNNELS :
"P648659700" "Sigil"
// Script Variable MISSION3_INTRO_CAVES :
"P727124883" "<color red>Spirit Stalkers</color><br><br>Our scouts have seen a group of Spirit Stalkers enter a cave in Night Ward. There is no doubt that Shadow Hunter has his pack hunting something, and there is no doubt that he can only be up to no good.<br><br>We believe he may be after a magical artifact that the Midnighter's have lost. {HeroName}, you must stop the pack leaders and recover that magical artifact!"
// Script Variable MISSION3_INTRO_CAVES :
"P357799449" "<color red>Drudges</color><br><br>The Drudges have stolen weapons from the Black Knight's armory. We believe they are trying to arm themselves with better weaponry in order to collect souls in a more efficient manner.<br><br>The Drudges must be made to pay for their actions. Bring down the leaders responsible for this and recover the missing items from the Black Knight's armory."
// Script Variable MISSION3_INTRO_CAVES :
"P608406245" "<color red>Animus Arcana</color><br><br>The Animus Arcana have found a pile of books belonging to the Midnighters that allows them to create their own magic. This is quickly getting out of hand, {HeroName}, as they're creating living creatures that they have no idea how to control or educate. These wild sparks of magic are going to wipe out Night Ward if we don't stop them.<br><br>You must stop the Animus Arcana who are able to utilize the book, then recover the books before it is too late."
// Script Variable MISSION3_ENTRY_CAVES :
"P441974569" "Whatever this artifact is, the Spirit Stalkers seem to be set on finding it."
// Script Variable MISSION3_ENTRY_CAVES :
"P1811224820" "The Drudges have stepped over the line and must be put back in their place."
// Script Variable MISSION3_ENTRY_CAVES :
"P1991894165" "The Animus Arcana could create their own unstable army of magical creatures if they're not stopped."
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS_NAME_CAVES :
"P1814289177" "Ecoem"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS_NAME_CAVES :
"P1679731581" "Assistant Taskmaster"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS_NAME_CAVES :
"P1727897366" "Educated Magic"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS_INACTIVE_CAVES :
"P2123109693" "Let's get those items ordered and distributed, boys."
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS_INACTIVE_CAVES :
"P2012131152" "Yay! I love making more magic! Let's see how many booms they can do!"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS_ACTIVE_CAVES :
"P171114062" "We've got an outsider here! Lookin' to recover those items, are you?"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS_ACTIVE_CAVES :
"P1042632436" "Are you to watch me make more life?"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS2_NAME_CAVES :
"P1685554235" "Epto"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS2_NAME_CAVES :
"P1262618101" "Lead Taskmaster"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS2_NAME_CAVES :
"P3047960067" "Learned Magic"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS2_INACTIVE_CAVES :
"P121693916" "These swords should let us get a whole lot of wax."
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS2_INACTIVE_CAVES :
"P1113064351" "This is so cool! What else can we make?"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS2_ACTIVE_CAVES :
"P365566686" "An outsider! Here to get in the way of our profits, are you?"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS2_ACTIVE_CAVES :
"P1387911184" "Oh, let's see if we can make you into magic!"
// Script Variable MISSION3_GLOWIE_NAME_CAVES :
"P719911946" "Midnighter Artifact"
// Script Variable MISSION3_GLOWIE_NAME_CAVES :
"P3746173378" "Black Knight Weapons"
// Script Variable MISSION3_GLOWIE_NAME_CAVES :
"P1127034082" "Midnighter Books"
// Script Variable MISSION3_INTRO_OFFICE :
"P1289292196" "<color red>Talons of Vengeance</color><br><br>The Talons of Vengeance have begun to set up a staging area in one of the offices within Night Ward. We're not sure what they're planning, but we did see them bring in a coffin. We believe it has the remains of one of their elder members; they may be trying to revive them in order to help in their struggle to destroy Night Ward.<br><br>{HeroName}, we require that you thwart the Talons in this and recover the remains of their elder."
// Script Variable MISSION3_INTRO_OFFICE :
"P2475152509" "<color red>Spirit Stalkers</color><br><br>The spirit of a famed hunter in Praetoria was recently sealed by the Drudges. Shadow Hunter and his pack have discovered this and are seeking out this crystal.<br><br>By now, the Drudges are most likely slaughtered, the animals having caught them by surprise. We must not allow the Spirit Stalkers to obtain that crystal, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable MISSION3_INTRO_OFFICE :
"P3948784849" "<color red>Animus Arcana</color><br><br>The Animus Arcana have managed to create an empowerment podium that can multiply the power of all nearby Animus Arcana. They, of course, did this for purely innocent reasons, simply looking to see if it would <i>work</i>. However, this item will cause untold destruction, as they have no idea how dangerous the power they wield is.<br><br>{HeroName}, you must stop the Animus Arcana who created this device, then recover the device before it is too late."
// Script Variable MISSION3_ENTRY_OFFICE :
"P1183795690" "Things could get bad if the Talons of Vengeance manage to revive one of their elders."
// Script Variable MISSION3_ENTRY_OFFICE :
"P3671650866" "You'll need to retrieve that crystal before Shadow Hunter's pack gains a dangerous advantage."
// Script Variable MISSION3_ENTRY_OFFICE :
"P3016586182" "Night Ward is fortunate that the Animus Arcana are not actively trying to destroy it; only accidentally."
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS_NAME_OFFICE :
"P1866171810" "Spiritual Oracle"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS_NAME_OFFICE :
"P781331483" "Avra"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS_NAME_OFFICE :
"P19398865" "Creator Magic"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS_INACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P1235118847" "She can be revived, sisters! We can find a way!"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS_INACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P377624181" "Let's see what else we can make!"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS_ACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P2582381270" "You will not stop the return of our sister!"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS_ACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P1109311461" "You're giving me all kinds of ideas for magic!"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS2_NAME_OFFICE :
"P647374400" "Ethereal Oracle"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS2_NAME_OFFICE :
"P1860487847" "Uting"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS2_NAME_OFFICE :
"P1514657561" "Imaginative Magic"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS2_INACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P2285791167" "The feast requires more! We must find a way to return her!"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS2_INACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P3532078495" "I've got all sorts of new theories for what we can create!"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS2_ACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P913771808" "You will feel our fury, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS2_ACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P2474182623" "Do you have some ideas too?"
// Script Variable MISSION3_GLOWIE_NAME_OFFICE :
"P365438177" "Elder's Remains"
// Script Variable MISSION3_GLOWIE_NAME_OFFICE :
"P2023057685" "Hunter's Spirit"
// Script Variable MISSION3_GLOWIE_NAME_OFFICE :
"P2400866953" "Empowerment Podium"
// Script Variable MISSION3_INTRO_TUNNELS :
"P1952743833" "<color red>Spirit Stalkers</color><br><br>We have word that the Spirit Stalkers are prowling within one of the tunnels beneath Night Ward. We have reason to believe that Shadow Hunter has sent them after a supposed treasure that is down there, a spear that would allow him empower his beasts.<br><br>We cannot allow that item to fall into Shadow Hunter's hands, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable MISSION3_INTRO_TUNNELS :
"P1082040427" "<color red>Apparitions</color><br><br>A group of Apparitions have viciously killed a number of Black Knights within the tunnels of Night Ward. Our last communication indicated they were out to destroy a memorial to one our of fallen. We can only assume this is being driven by vengeful spectres.<br><br>Please, {HeroName}, recover the item from the memorial and ensure these angry spectres do not continue in their killing spree."
// Script Variable MISSION3_INTRO_TUNNELS :
"P2745471117" "<color red>Drudges</color><br><br>A group of Drudges attacked some of my knights within the tunnels. We discovered the altercation arose when the Drudges learned we were guarding some of their precious 'wax'.<br><br>This 'wax' was recovered by one of our scouting parties; if the Drudges had simply requested it, we would have given it to them. However, they have resorted to violence and chaos.<br><br>The Drudges must be shown such actions will not be tolerated here in Night Ward, {HeroName}. Recover their wax, and defeat the masters of this group."
// Script Variable MISSION3_ENTRY_TUNNELS :
"P1731567650" "You'll have to retrieve this spear before Shadow Hunter and his beasts do!"
// Script Variable MISSION3_ENTRY_TUNNELS :
"P3568501792" "The Apparitions are allowing their blind hate to consume them. You'll have to put them down before they hurt anyone else."
// Script Variable MISSION3_ENTRY_TUNNELS :
"P4207196828" "The Drudges ambition for wax has caused them to be blinded to any form of reason."
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS_NAME_TUNNELS :
"P3938516366" "Raet"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS_NAME_TUNNELS :
"P179021137" "Vengeful Spectre"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS_NAME_TUNNELS :
"P2800555557" "Greedy Taskmaster"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS_INACTIVE_TUNNELS :
"P2481852954" "NO REST! NOT FOR THE KNIGHTS! NOT FOR ANYONE! NOT UNTIL THERE IS JUSTICE!"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS_INACTIVE_TUNNELS :
"P3441204077" "It's in here somewhere, gentlemen."
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS_ACTIVE_TUNNELS :
"P4013201632" "YOU WILL NOT STOP MY JUSTICE! MY! JUSTICE!"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS_ACTIVE_TUNNELS :
"P3939401006" "An outsider! Why is this never simple?"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS2_NAME_TUNNELS :
"P918895628" "Velo"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS2_INACTIVE_TUNNELS :
"P3511787570" "DESTROY! EVERYTHING!"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS2_INACTIVE_TUNNELS :
"P2291804185" "Those arrogant little... keeping the payment from US?"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS2_ACTIVE_TUNNELS :
"P2715954710" "DESTROY YOU!"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS2_ACTIVE_TUNNELS :
"P483159124" "I can smell you, outsider!"
// Script Variable MISSION3_GLOWIE_NAME_TUNNELS :
"P300027664" "Ancient Spear"
// Script Variable MISSION3_GLOWIE_NAME_TUNNELS :
"P182856494" "Black Knight Memorial"
// Script Variable MISSION3_GLOWIE_NAME_TUNNELS :
"P3567274626" "Drudge's Wax"

